## Project Structure

```
KADA-Food-Roulette/
├── Food Roulette-web/              # React + Vite web app
│   └── src/
│       ├── features/              # Feature-based modules
│       ├── components/           # Shared components
│       └── ...
├── backend/                       # Express.js + Prisma
│   ├── prisma/                   # Database schema & migrations
│   └── src/                      # Backend source
├── brand/                         # Design & brand docs
│   ├── prompts.md               # Single source of truth
│   ├── brand.md                 # Design tokens
│   └── FOOD-ROULETTE-SITEMAP.md # Feature specs
├── Content/                       # Strategy & exploration docs
│   └── explore/                  # Strategy docs
├── docs/                          # ERD & technical docs
├── .agents/skills/               # Agent skills (Cursor)
├── VIBE_RULES.md                 # Golden rules
├── CLAUDE.md                      # Entry point
└── AGENTS.md                     # Agent conventions
```

---

## Allowed Commands

| Command | When OK |
|---------|---------|
| Read, Glob, Grep | Always |
| Shell (npm install, build, lint) | Always |
| Write, StrReplace | In allowed folders only |
| Delete | Only if explicitly asked |

## Blocked Commands

| Command | Why Blocked |
|---------|-------------|
| git push | Must be approved |
| rm -rf | Destructive |
| npm publish | Deployment must be approved |

---

## Onboarding Flow for New AI Session

```
1. AI reads CLAUDE.md
2. AI reads VIBE_RULES.md §1-2 (golden rules)
3. AI reads relevant AGENTS.md §10 (role template)
4. AI is ready to assist
```

